The '''Normal Ticket Festival!!''' is a group of special stages appearing during special occasions. During this event, [[:Category:Cat Ticket Stages|Cat Ticket]] stages appear more often than usual.

==Cat Ticket Stages==
*[[Love, Metal Hippoe (Hard)|Cat Ticket Chance!]]
*[[Super Metal Hippoe (Expert)|Super Metal Hippoe]]

==First Appearance==
*January 22nd, 2015 to January 29th, 2015

